"uf1fffe8f\" data-lake-id=\"ua0b61191\" id=\"ua0b61191\"><span data-lake-id=\"u06604753\" id=\"u06604753\">动态调整：初始r=32（高复杂度任务）→ 收敛后降至r=16</span></li><li fid=\"uf1fffe8f\" data-lake-id=\"u3185f66b\" id=\"u3185f66b\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0f29e699\" id=\"u0f29e699\">效果</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc6987cc2\" id=\"uc6987cc2\">： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"ub4e3cd2e\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u8ca24849\" data-lake-id=\"u846bed75\" id=\"u846bed75\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4a2d3258\" id=\"u4a2d3258\">高秩阶段：快速学习新语法（BLEU↑12%）</span></li><li fid=\"u8ca24849\" data-lake-id=\"ua8abaa70\" id=\"ua8abaa70\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7a067439\" id=\"u7a067439\">低秩阶段：固化知识，减少过拟合（推理速度↑40%）</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u6ffd2bd6\" id=\"u6ffd2bd6\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2d470f66\" id=\"u2d470f66\">关键经验</span></strong></p><ul list=\"u80deb1bd\"><li fid=\"ua3f0b7cd\" data-lake-id=\"u2ebcbc48\" id=\"u2ebcbc48\"><span data-lake-id=\"u570275f0\" id=\"u570275f0\">高秩（r≥32）适用场景：语法结构重构、跨模态对齐</span></li><li fid=\"ua3f0b7cd\" data-lake-id=\"u2afe1f15\" id=\"u2afe1f15\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6403792e\" id=\"u6403792e\">低秩（r≤8）适用场景：风格迁移、防过拟合</span></li></ul><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22K3CDM%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"c1822661\" id=\"c1822661\"><span data-lake-id=\"u16394bc0\" id=\"u16394bc0\">三、示例回答</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u8f3c304a\" id=\"u8f3c304a\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1751696368832-5ed65da8-4d64-430d-a23d-c69167d5a780.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ub645695a-e59c-4600-800c-ecdfbf9ad64%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uc3464edd-a177-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A411.73333333333335%2C%22height%22%3A205%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A59969%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A772%2C%22originHeight%22%3A385%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22stat